  "author": {"name":"Aggelos Mouzakitis","href":"/about/","image":"/img/aggelos-about.webp","width":840,"height":1050,"alt":"Aggelos Mouzakitis, author and psychotherapist","credential":"BACP-registered Psychotherapist · MSc Integrative Counselling & Psychotherapy","background":"Background in product and growth · 100+ technology companies advised"},
